### \`tls.d.grouped-bar\` — Grouped Bar Chart

Side-by-side columns or bars per category, one colour per series. _(family: data; keywords: grouped, clustered, bar, column, compare)_

**When:** Comparing 2-4 series across categories (region by year).
**Avoid:** One series (use tls.d.bar); parts of a total (use tls.d.stacked-bar).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`categories\` | yes | list of text (max 24 chars) (2–12 items) | Axis labels, 1-2 words each. |
| \`series\` | yes | list of object (name, values) (2–4 items) | One entry per series; values match categories. |
| \`orientation\` | no | enum: vertical \\\\| horizontal |  |
| \`groupGap\` | no | enum: md \\\\| sm \\\\| lg |  |
| \`valueLabels\` | no | enum: none \\\\| end \\\\| inside |  |
| \`gridlines\` | no | enum: major \\\\| none |  |
| \`format\` | no | enum: plain \\\\| compact \\\\| percent \\\\| currency |  |
| \`legend\` | no | enum: top \\\\| bottom \\\\| right \\\\| none |  |
| \`highlightIndex\` | no | number (min -1) | Category to emphasise; others dim. -1 = none. |

