|---|---|---|---|
| \`rows\` | yes | list of text (max 24 chars) (2–12 items) |  |
| \`cols\` | yes | list of text (max 16 chars) (2–12 items) | Short: they sit above narrow cells. |
| \`values\` | yes | list of list of number | values[row][col]; missing or non-numeric = empty cell. |
| \`ramp\` | no | enum: accent \\\\| diverging | diverging: negative / zero / positive |
| \`showValues\` | no | boolean |  |
| \`format\` | no | enum: plain \\\\| compact \\\\| percent \\\\| currency |  |

