### \`tls.d.pie\` — Pie Chart

Pie of up to six slices with outside, inside or legend labels and percentages. _(family: data; keywords: pie, share, proportion, whole, percent, chart)_

**When:** Share of a whole with up to 6 parts.
**Avoid:** Similar-sized shares (use tls.d.bar); a ring with a centre number (use tls.d.donut).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`categories\` | yes | list of text (max 24 chars) (2–6 items) | One name per slice. |
| \`values\` | yes | list of number (2–6 items) | One non-negative number per category. |
| \`labels\` | no | enum: outside \\\\| inside \\\\| legend |  |
| \`showPercent\` | no | boolean |  |
| \`sort\` | no | enum: desc \\\\| none | desc = largest slice first. |
| \`highlightIndex\` | no | number (min -1) | Slice to emphasise; others dim. -1 = none. |
| \`startAngle\` | no | number | Degrees clockwise from 12 o'clock. |

