### \`tls.d.scatter\` — Scatter Plot

Points on nice x and y axes; group colours, quadrant lines, trend line, point labels. _(family: data; keywords: scatter, correlation, xy, plot, quadrant, regression)_

**When:** Correlation, positioning of items on two measures.
**Avoid:** Qualitative positioning (use tls.g.matrix-2x2).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`points\` | yes | list of object (x, y, label, group) (3–60 items) |  |
| \`quadrants\` | no | boolean | Cross lines at the middle of each axis. |
| \`trendline\` | no | boolean | Least-squares fit. |
| \`labelPoints\` | no | enum: none \\\\| highlighted \\\\| all |  |
| \`highlightIndex\` | no | number (min -1) | Point to emphasise; others dim. -1 = none. |
| \`gridlines\` | no | enum: major \\\\| none |  |
| \`format\` | no | enum: plain \\\\| compact \\\\| percent \\\\| currency |  |
| \`legend\` | no | enum: top \\\\| bottom \\\\| right \\\\| none |  |

\`\`\`json
{
