### \`tls.d.scorecard\` — Scorecard

Metric rows with the actual value, a target, and a green / amber / red status. _(family: data; keywords: scorecard, okr, kpi review, status, rag, health, sla)_

**When:** OKR reviews, project health, SLA reports.
**Avoid:** Raw data tables (tls.d.table). One metric: tls.c.kpi-tile.

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`items\` | yes | list of object (label, value, target, status, note) (2–10 items) | Values and targets are text with units (\\"$4.2M\\", \\"98%\\"). |
| \`showTarget\` | no | boolean |  |
| \`statusStyle\` | no | enum: dot \\\\| pill \\\\| bar | bar = colour strip at the row start, no status column |
| \`showNote\` | no | boolean |  |

