### \`tls.d.sparkline\` — Sparkline

Axis-free trend line with optional label, area tint, end dot and last value or change. _(family: data; keywords: sparkline, trend, mini chart, inline, tile)_

**When:** A trend hint next to a number, in tables or tiles.
**Avoid:** A chart someone must read values from (use tls.d.line).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`values\` | yes | list of number (3–60 items) | Ordered values, oldest first. |
| \`label\` | no | text (max 30 chars) |  |
| \`fill\` | no | boolean | Tint the area under the line. |
| \`endDot\` | no | boolean |  |
| \`showLast\` | no | enum: none \\\\| value \\\\| delta | delta = last minus first. |
| \`format\` | no | enum: plain \\\\| compact \\\\| percent \\\\| currency |  |

\`\`\`json
{
  \\"id\\": \\"b_spark\\",
  \\"type\\": \\"tls.d.sparkline\\",
