### \`tls.d.stacked-bar\` — Stacked Bar Chart

Stacked columns or bars with optional 100% scaling and totals. _(family: data; keywords: stacked, composition, total, share, bar)_

**When:** Composition of a total across categories; with normalize, compare the mix.
**Avoid:** Comparing individual series values (use tls.d.grouped-bar).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`categories\` | yes | list of text (max 24 chars) (2–12 items) | Axis labels, 1-2 words each. |
| \`series\` | yes | list of object (name, values) (2–6 items) | One entry per series; values match categories. |
| \`orientation\` | no | enum: vertical \\\\| horizontal |  |
| \`normalize\` | no | boolean |  |
| \`totals\` | no | boolean |  |
| \`valueLabels\` | no | enum: none \\\\| inside |  |
| \`gridlines\` | no | enum: major \\\\| none |  |
| \`format\` | no | enum: plain \\\\| compact \\\\| percent \\\\| currency |  |
| \`legend\` | no | enum: top \\\\| bottom \\\\| right \\\\| none |  |
| \`highlightIndex\` | no | number (min -1) | Category to emphasise; others dim. -1 = none. |

\`\`\`json
{
  \\"id\\": \\"b_stacked\\",
  \\"type\\": \\"tls.d.stacked-bar\\",
  \\"props\\": {
    \\"categories\\": [
      \\"2024\\",
      \\"2025\\"
