### \`tls.d.table\` — Table

Table with header, aligned numbers, status dots, ratings and a totals row. _(family: data; keywords: table, grid, rows, columns, spreadsheet, schedule, specs)_

**When:** Exact values in rows and columns (schedules, specs, results).
**Avoid:** Fewer than 3 values (tls.c.kpi-row). Options vs criteria: tls.d.compare-table.

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`columns\` | yes | list of object (label, kind, align, width) (1–8 items) | Set kind: number for figures. |
| \`rows\` | yes | list of list of text (max 60 chars) (1–14 items) | One string per column. |
| \`footer\` | no | list of text (max 40 chars) |  |
| \`zebra\` | no | boolean |  |
| \`rules\` | no | enum: horizontal \\\\| head \\\\| none |  |
| \`header\` | no | enum: filled \\\\| bold \\\\| none |  |
| \`emphasisRow\` | no | number (min -1) |  |
| \`emphasisCol\` | no | number (min -1) |  |
| \`density\` | no | enum: default \\\\| compact |  |
| \`format\` | no | enum: plain \\\\| compact \\\\| percent \\\\| currency |  |
| \`showFooter\` | no | boolean |  |

\`\`\`json
{
  \\"id\\": \\"b_table\\",
  \\"type\\": \\"tls.d.table\\",
  \\"props\\": {
    \\"columns\\": [
      {
        \\"label\\": \\"Plan\\"
      },
      {
        \\"label\\": \\"Seats\\",
        \\"kind\\": \\"number\\"
      },
      {
        \\"label\\": \\"Price\\",
        \\"kind\\": \\"number\\"
      }
    ],
    \\"rows\\": [
      [
        \\"Starter\\",
        \\"5\\",
        \\"$49\\"
      ],
      [
        \\"Team\\",
        \\"25\\",
        \\"$199\\"
      ]
    ],
    \\"footer\\": [
      \\"Total\\",
      \\"30\\",
      \\"$248\\"
    ],
    \\"zebra\\": true
  }
}
\`\`\`

### \`tls.d.trend-badge\` — Trend Badge

Pill with a triangle arrow and a signed change, coloured by direction and polarity. _(family: data; keywords: trend, badge, delta, change, arrow, up, down)_

**When:** Annotating a number elsewhere on the slide with its trend.
**Avoid:** A standalone metric (use tls.c.kpi-tile).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`delta\` | yes | number | Signed change; the sign sets the arrow. |
| \`label\` | no | text (max 30 chars) | Short context after the value. |
| \`format\` | no | enum: plain \\\\| compact \\\\| percent \\\\| currency |  |
| \`polarity\` | no | enum: upGood \\\\| downGood \\\\| neutral | Which direction is good. |
| \`size\` | no | enum: md \\\\| sm \\\\| lg |  |

\`\`\`json
{
  \\"id\\": \\"b_trend\\",
  \\"type\\": \\"tls.d.trend-badge\\",
  \\"props\\": {
    \\"delta\\": -3.2,
    \\"format\\": \\"percent\\",
    \\"polarity\\": \\"downGood\\",
    \\"label\\": \\"churn\\"
  }
}
