|---|---|---|---|
| \`gap\` | no | enum: 3xs \\\\| 2xs \\\\| xs \\\\| sm \\\\| md \\\\| lg \\\\| xl \\\\| 2xl \\\\| 3xl \\\\| 4xl | Spacing between row children. |
| \`children\` | no | blocks (allow: layout, text, data, diagram, composite, media) | Child blocks arranged horizontally. |
| \`sizing\` | no | enum: equal \\\\| content | How to distribute space among children: equal (same size) or content (sized to intrinsic). |

