| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`inset\` | no | enum: 3xs \\\\| 2xs \\\\| xs \\\\| sm \\\\| md \\\\| lg \\\\| xl \\\\| 2xl \\\\| 3xl \\\\| 4xl | Safe-area inset on all sides. |
| \`children\` | no | blocks (allow: layout, text, data, diagram, composite, media) | Child blocks laid out inside the safe area. |

