| \`showTitle\` | no | boolean | Toggle the section title on/off. |
| \`showDivider\` | no | boolean | Toggle the divider line below the title on/off. |
| \`gap\` | no | enum: 3xs \\\\| 2xs \\\\| xs \\\\| sm \\\\| md \\\\| lg \\\\| xl \\\\| 2xl \\\\| 3xl \\\\| 4xl | Spacing between title and children. |
| \`children\` | no | blocks (allow: layout, text, data, diagram, composite, media) | Child blocks laid out below the title. |

